  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "LankaLens.AdministrativeDivisions 0.1.0-preview.2\n\n  Changes in this preview:\n  - Added the official LankaLens NuGet package icon.\n  - Improved NuGet package metadata and presentation.\n  - Kept Poorna Soysa as the package author.\n  - No breaking changes to the public API.\n  - No changes to the administrative hierarchy or bundled dataset.\n\n  Bundled administrative snapshot:\n  - 9 Provinces\n  - 25 Districts\n  - 340 Divisional Secretariat Divisions\n  - 14,008 Grama Niladhari Divisions\n  - Complete English names\n  - Sinhala and Tamil names for all Provinces, Districts, and Divisional Secretariat Divisions\n  - Sinhala and Tamil names for 13,723 of 14,008 Grama Niladhari Divisions\n\n  Unverified Sinhala/Tamil GN names remain null rather than being machine-generated.\n\n  The package continues to provide offline hierarchy navigation, code-based lookups, and multilingual search with no database or network dependency.\n\n  This is a prerelease version and the public API may still evolve before 1.0.0.",
